 "text": "Monday won't fix it. We love a fresh start, next Monday then the first of the month, then January, and every time the start date moves again. Here's the thing, Monday doesn't change anything. You'll have the same goal, the same doubts, just less time. So start today but start small. Pick the first step of your goal that fits in 15 minutes, want to change jobs, update one section of your CV tonight. Then tomorrow do the next step in the next. By the time Monday comes you're not starting from zero, you're already a few steps in. A fresh start isn't a date, it's the first step you actually take. That's what Demure is for, you archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do. If you want to try it out I've put the link in the bio.",
