 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 5.24,
   "text": "Monday won't fix it. We love a fresh start, next Monday then the first of the month, then January,"
  },
  {
   "s": 5.86,
   "e": 10.18,
   "text": "and every time the start date moves again. Here's the thing, Monday doesn't change anything."
  },
  {
   "s": 10.62,
   "e": 13.16,
   "text": "You'll have the same goal, the same doubts, just less time."
  },
  {
   "s": 13.64,
   "e": 18.08,
   "text": "So start today but start small. Pick the first step of your goal that fits in 15 minutes,"
  },
  {
   "s": 18.5,
   "e": 23.56,
   "text": "want to change jobs, update one section of your CV tonight. Then tomorrow do the next step in the"
  },
  {
   "s": 23.56,
   "e": 28.22,
   "text": "next. By the time Monday comes you're not starting from zero, you're already a few steps in."
  },
  {
   "s": 28.22,
   "e": 33.5,
   "text": "A fresh start isn't a date, it's the first step you actually take. That's what Demure is for,"
  },
  {
   "s": 33.86,
   "e": 37.86,
   "text": "you archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small"
  },
  {
   "s": 37.86,
   "e": 42.14,
   "text": "steps you can actually do. If you want to try it out I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
